# Ignore everything in this directory EXCEPT the two models eSim ships.
#
# This is a RUNTIME directory: the legacy NgVeri (Verilator) flow writes
# <model>.xml here for every model a user adds, and NgVeri._list_models reads
# it back. Local models must never be committed -- they would ship to every
# user of the release.
#
# The two exceptions below are upstream demo models that arrived with the
# sky130-fd-pr PDK + analog IPs (37b9194b, 2022) and are part of what eSim
# distributes. Do not add to this list without deciding it belongs in a
# release.
*
!.gitignore
!dvsd_8_bit_priority_encoder.xml
!vsdserializer_v1.xml
